---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /restaurante.html
lang: es
active: restaurante
title: Restaurante y cartas | Hotel Playa de Aguilar ****
description: Carta del restaurante y carta de desayunos del Hotel Playa de Aguilar. Cocina asturiana de producto local frente al Cantábrico.
canonicalPath: /restaurante.html
altEs: /restaurante.html
altEn: /en/restaurant.html
---
<section class="hero short">
  <div class="hero-bg" style="background-image:url('/assets/img/restaurante.jpg')"></div>
  <div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Restaurante</div><h1>Sabor de Asturias frente al mar</h1></div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal"><div class="eyebrow">Carta del restaurante</div><h2>Nuestra cocina</h2>
      <p>{{ menus.restaurant_intro_es }}</p>
      {% if menus.restaurantPdf %}<p class="reveal" style="margin-top:14px"><a class="btn" href="{{ menus.restaurantPdf }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Descargar carta del restaurante (PDF)</a></p>{% endif %}</div>
    <div class="menu">
      {%- for sec in menus.restaurant_sections %}
      <div class="menu-sec reveal"><h3>{{ sec.title_es }}</h3>
        {%- for it in sec.items %}
        <div class="menu-item"><div class="mi-main"><span class="mi-name">{{ it.name_es }}</span>{% if it.price %}<span class="mi-price">{{ it.price }}</span>{% endif %}</div>{% if it.desc_es %}<p class="mi-desc">{{ it.desc_es }}</p>{% endif %}</div>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal"><div class="eyebrow">Carta de desayunos</div><h2>Para empezar el día</h2>
      <p>{{ menus.breakfast_intro_es }}</p>
      {% if menus.breakfastPdf %}<p class="reveal" style="margin-top:14px"><a class="btn ghost" href="{{ menus.breakfastPdf }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Descargar carta de desayunos (PDF)</a></p>{% endif %}</div>
    <div class="menu">
      {%- for sec in menus.breakfast_sections %}
      <div class="menu-sec reveal"><h3>{{ sec.title_es }}</h3>
        {%- for it in sec.items %}
        <div class="menu-item"><div class="mi-main"><span class="mi-name">{{ it.name_es }}</span>{% if it.price %}<span class="mi-price">{{ it.price }}</span>{% endif %}</div>{% if it.desc_es %}<p class="mi-desc">{{ it.desc_es }}</p>{% endif %}</div>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="center" style="margin-top:36px"><a class="btn" href="{{ site.bookingEs }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Reservar estancia</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
